## 📄 `02_MODELO_DE_DATOS.md`

```markdown
# Modelo de datos (Drizzle / Turso)

## Tablas principales

### users
- id (uuid, pk)
- username (unique, slug para URL)
- email (unique)
- password_hash
- role: 'SUPER_ADMIN' | 'CREATOR' | 'CONSUMER' | 'AGENCY'
- status: 'PENDING' | 'ACTIVE' | 'SUSPENDED'
- kyc_status: 'NONE' | 'PENDING' | 'APPROVED' | 'REJECTED'
- birth_date (para verificación de edad)
- created_at, updated_at

### profiles
- user_id (fk users)
- display_name
- bio
- avatar_key (R2)
- banner_key (R2)
- subscription_price_koin (mensualidad)
- is_published

### wallets
- user_id (fk users, 1:1)
- balance_koin (decimal 18,2)
- updated_at

### wallet_transactions
- id
- user_id
- type: 'TOPUP_USDT' | 'CONVERSION' | 'PURCHASE' | 'SUBSCRIPTION' |
        'CREATOR_PAYOUT' | 'REFUND' | 'ADJUSTMENT'
- amount_koin
- amount_usdt (nullable)
- reference (tx hash Binance o id interno)
- status: 'PENDING' | 'CONFIRMED' | 'REJECTED'
- validated_by (fk users, SUPER_ADMIN)
- created_at, confirmed_at

### payment_methods (configurables por creador)
- id
- creator_id (fk users)
- type: 'BANK_TRANSFER' | 'PAGOMOVIL' | 'BINANCE'
- bank_id (nullable, 1..30 si BANK_TRANSFER/PAGOMOVIL)
- account_number
- account_holder
- id_document
- binance_email (si BINANCE)
- is_active
- display_order

### banks (seed fijo — 30 registros)
- id (1..30), nombre_banco
(Ver listado completo en 03_ROLES_Y_FLUJOS.md)

### posts (contenido individual)
- id
- creator_id
- title, description
- price_koin
- is_package_item (bool)
- status: 'DRAFT' | 'PENDING_REVIEW' | 'APPROVED' | 'REJECTED'
- reviewed_by, reviewed_at
- created_at

### media_assets
- id
- post_id (nullable, si va dentro de package)
- type: 'IMAGE' | 'VIDEO'
- original_key (R2)
- preview_key (R2)
- mime_type, size_bytes, duration_s
- sort_order
- moderation_status: 'PENDING' | 'OK' | 'BLOCKED'

### packages
- id
- creator_id
- title, description
- price_koin
- status (igual que posts)
- created_at

### package_items
- package_id, post_id, sort_order

### purchases
- id
- buyer_id (consumer)
- item_type: 'POST' | 'PACKAGE'
- item_id
- price_koin
- status: 'PENDING' | 'COMPLETED' | 'REFUNDED'
- created_at

### subscriptions
- id
- subscriber_id
- creator_id
- price_koin_snapshot
- starts_at, ends_at
- auto_renew (bool)
- status: 'ACTIVE' | 'EXPIRED' | 'CANCELLED'

### payouts (cortes semanales)
- id
- creator_id
- period_start, period_end
- gross_koin, fee_koin, net_koin
- payment_method_id (fk)
- status: 'PENDING' | 'PROCESSING' | 'PAID' | 'FAILED'
- paid_by (SUPER_ADMIN), paid_at, proof_key (R2 comprobante)

### kyc_documents
- id
- user_id
- document_type ('CEDULA_VE')
- front_key, back_key (R2, privado)
- selfie_key (R2, privado)
- extracted_cedula (resultado del OCR de reconocimiento_cedula)
- age_verified (bool)
- reviewer_id, reviewed_at
- status

### creator_contracts
- id
- creator_id
- accepted_at
- ip_address
- user_agent
- contract_version (string)
- pdf_key (R2)

### agencies
- id
- owner_user_id
- name, logo_key, description
- commission_pct
- status

### agency_creators
- agency_id, creator_id, joined_at

### moderation_flags
- id
- media_asset_id (nullable) | post_id (nullable)
- reason: 'CSAM' | 'GORE' | 'VIOLENCE' | 'OTHER'
- flagged_by (user), notes
- status: 'OPEN' | 'RESOLVED'

### audit_log
- id, actor_id, action, entity, entity_id, meta(json), created_at
